# Exclude paths from the Docker build context. The repo ships TWO
# Dockerfiles — main `Dockerfile` (Fastify) and `src/admin-ui/Dockerfile`
# (Next.js admin-ui). Both use the same build context (the repo root), so
# this file applies to both.
#
# Why this exists (Codex Adversarial Review on PR #176, [medium]):
#   `COPY . .` in either Dockerfile would otherwise drag local `.env`,
#   `.git`, `.baileys-auth/`, `media/`, `node_modules/`, and `.next/` into
#   the build context. That bloats the image, leaks operator secrets into
#   intermediate layers (and remote builder caches), and slows the build.

# ─── Secrets / operator state ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# .env.example IS public and intentionally included.

# ─── Auth / runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.baileys-auth/
auth_info_baileys/
media/
uploads/

# ─── Version control ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ─── Node / build artifacts (not needed in image, will be reinstalled) ──
node_modules
src/admin-ui/node_modules
dist
.next
src/admin-ui/.next
src/admin-ui/out
*.tsbuildinfo
.cache
.turbo
coverage
.nyc_output

# ─── Editor / OS junk ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ─── Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs
*.log
*.log.*

# ─── Local PG / Redis volumes (dev only) ─────────────────────────────────
pg_data
redis_data

# ─── Claude scratch files ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude
p8.5-plan.md
p8.5-spec.md

# ─── Test fixtures that aren't needed in the runtime image ──────────────
tests
backups
